{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45140","headline":"送穆寂赴举 · 皎然","name":"送穆寂赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天子锡玄纁，倾山礼隐沦。\n君抛青霞去，荣资观国宾。\n劒光既陆离，琼彩何璘玢。\n夙驾别情远，商弦秋意新。\n冥冥鸿鹄姿，数尺看苍旻。\n残寇近宋郊，西行恶飙尘。\n立身素耿介，处难思经纶。\n春府搜才日，高科得一人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}